      "message": "pm-260/t-1578: Reject malformed predecessor and progress evidence\n\nD6: a present after_plan_id that is not a non-empty string (248, {},\n[], \"\") is plan_after_plan_id_unsupported, never a cleared edge.\ntrace_id and execution_started_at get the same check.\nD7-D9: progress reason, holders and every holder are validated before\nnormalizing; an object reason, string holders or a numeric holder id\nis a per-source input error (plan_/schedule_progress_*_unsupported),\nnot \"no reason\" or \"no holder\". Omitted/null reason and holders stay\nsupported. get_plan and explain_schedule must also name the same\nholders.\n\nEvaluator and CLI regressions cover each source separately under a\nverified manifest; QA's run-8812 live capture still exits 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
